g: 22px 24px;\"><div style=\"font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--deck-muted);\">First-time fix rate</div><div style=\"font-size: 64px; font-weight: 700; font-family: var(--deck-heading-font, var(--ds-heading-font, var(--deck-body-font, sans-serif))); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; color: var(--deck-accent); line-height: 1.1; margin-top: 8px;\">87%</div><div style=\"font-size: 15px; color: var(--deck-muted);\">up from 71% last year</div></div></div></div>"
